{
  "name": "dsh-shinki-svn-graph",
  "version": "0.1.9",
  "description": "DSH 侧边栏 SVN 插件：探测当前工作区与其一级子目录中的 Subversion 工作副本，读取提交日志（默认最近 20 条）与本地改动，支持拉取(svn update)/添加(svn add)/提交(svn commit)。认证采用「系统凭据优先、交互式输入兜底」：默认复用 svn 自己的凭据链（macOS 上即钥匙串），不可用时才在面板里输入账号密码（密码经 stdin 传递，不进命令行）。",
  "type": "module",
  "main": "lib/index.js",
  "exports": {
    ".": "./lib/index.js",
    "./client": "./lib/client.js",
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "dsh": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    },
    "client": {
      "inject": [
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-modules",
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-locale"
      ],
      "platform": "web"
    }
  },
  "files": [
    "lib",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "README.md"
  ],
  "keywords": [
    "dsh",
    "dsh-plugin",
    "svn",
    "subversion",
    "sidebar",
    "vcs"
  ],
  "license": "Apache-2.0",
  "engines": {
    "node": ">=20"
  },
  "scripts": {
    "test": "node --test"
  }
}
